        "original_id": "3de8c971-56aa-5650-8fe3-bf9c9ea2aaca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Eastern Kentucky University, Ohio Valley Conference\n- Teams: 2013–14 Eastern Kentucky Colonels basketball team\n- People: Jeff Neubauer\n- Places: McBrayer Arena, Alumni Coliseum\n- Concepts: 2013–14 NCAA Division I men's basketball season, East Division\n\nFacts:\n- The 2013–14 Eastern Kentucky Colonels basketball team represented Eastern Kentucky University during the 2013–14 NCAA Division I men's basketball season.\n- Jeff Neubauer was the ninth-year head coach of the 2013–14 Eastern Kentucky Colonels basketball team.\n- The 2013–14 Eastern Kentucky Colonels basketball team played its home games at McBrayer Arena within Alumni Coliseum.\n- The 2013–14 Eastern Kentucky Colonels basketball team was a member of the East Division of the Ohio Valley Conference.\n- The Ohio Valley Conference has 12 members, and 9 of them compete in football in the conference.",
